ul.li:
a kind string that says whether the traces were simulated or
          measured; for simulated traces it MUST contain the
          words "not silicon";

a list of effects not modelled (for example glitches,
          coupling, IR drop, electromagnetic emanation, process variation,
          parasitics after placement and routing);

source: how the platform information was obtained, for example
        TPM2_GetCapability for TPM_PT_MANUFACTURER and TPM_PT_VENDOR_STRING_1
        , or "none" when no TPM was used;
